  "solution": {
    "text": "We have, <math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math> which is homogeneous.<br /><br />Put,&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> so that <math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math><br /><br />Integrating, we get,&nbsp;<br /><br /><math><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>.</mo></math><br /><br />&nbsp;"
